{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06685","headline":"奉酬张五丈垂赠 · 储光羲","name":"奉酬张五丈垂赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩服去江汜，白云生大梁。\n星辰动异色，羔鴈成新行。\n日望天朝近，时忧郢路长。\n情言间薖轴，惠念及沧浪。\n松柏以之茂，江湖亦自忘。\n贾生方吊屈，岂敢比南昌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}